ection_type": "AUTH_CONT", "type": "paragraph"}, "offset": 24644, "text": "PC reviewed and performed initial classification of the genetic variants and wrote the manuscript. MKW contributed to the study design, generated the list of genetic variants identified in LLFS, performed the statistical analysis and edited the manuscript. TD contributed to the study design and reviewed the manuscript. JHL contributed to the study design, statistical analysis and edited the manuscript. JMZ contributed to the study design, statistical analysis and edited the manuscript. BT developed the study design, oversaw the variant classification, statistical analysis and responsible for manuscript preparation. All authors have read and approved the manuscript.", "sentences": [], "annotations": [{"id": "21931", "infons": {"identifier": "5091", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "5422", "valid": true, "normalized": [5091], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 5091, "biotype": "gene", "name": "PC", "accession": "@GENE_PC"}, "text": "PC", "locations": [{"offset": 24644, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "21932", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D004409", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D004409"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D004409", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Dyskinesia Drug-Induced", "accession": "@DISEASE_Dyskinesia_Drug_Induced"}, "text": "TD", "locations": [{"offset": 24901, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "21933", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D000094024", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D000094024"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D000094024", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Post-Acute COVID-19 Syndrome", "accession": "@DISEASE_Post_Acute_COVID_19_Syndrome"}, "text": "LLFS", "locations": [{"offset": 24833, "length": 4}]}], "relations": []}, {"infons": {"section_type": "ACK_FUND", "type": "title"}, "offset": 25318, "text": "Funding", "sentences": [], "annotations": [], "relations": []}, {"infons": {"section_type": "ACK_FUND", "type": "paragraph"}, "offset": 25326, "text": "This work was supported by the National Institute on Aging (NIA cooperative agreements U01-AG023712, U01-AG23744, U01-AG023746, U01-AG023749, and U01-AG023755). The funding agency provided input into the LLFS study design and data collection. However, the funding agency was not involved in the design of this analysis, data interpretation and in writing the manuscript.", "sentences": [], "annotations": [{"id": "21934", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D000094024", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D000094024"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D000094024", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Post-Acute COVID-19 Syndrome", "accession": "@DISEASE_Post_Acute_COVID_19_Syndrome"}, "text": "LLFS", "locations": [{"offset": 25530, "length": 4}]}], "relations": []}, {"infons": {"section_type": "METHODS", "type": "title"}, "offset": 25697, "text": "Availability of data and materials", "sentences": [], "annotations": [], "relations": []}, {"infons": {"section_type": "METHODS", "type": "paragraph"}, "offset": 25732, "text": "The datasets generated and/or analyzed during the current study are available in the dbGAP repository, https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/projects/gap/cgi-bin/study.cgi?study_id=phs000397.v1.p1", "sentences": [], "annotations": [], "relations": []}, {"infons": {"section_type": "METHODS", "type": "title"}, "offset": 25920, "text": "Ethics approval and consent to participate", "sentences": [], "annotations": [], "relations": []}, {"infons": {"section_type": "METHODS", "type": "paragraph"}, "offset": 25963, "text": "Signed informed consent was obtained from all study participants prior to study participation. This study was approved by the Institutional Review Boards at University of Minnesota, Washington University, Boston University, University of Pittsburgh and Columbia University.", "sentences": [], "annotations": [{"id": "21935", "infons": {"identifier": "9606", "type": "Species", "valid": true, "normalize